{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01KbAJ2GRkMr7xWzY5Jv6xwN", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Site_of_Special_Scientific_Interest_(Hong_Kong)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.tpb.gov.hk/tc/uploads/TPB/paper/10822_Appendix.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.tpb.gov.hk/sc/forms/Schedule_Notes/msn_sssi_c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://amp.scmp.com/article/709004/officials-throw-out-owners-bid-legalise-dumping\"}, {\"url\": \"https://waihekegulfnews.co.nz/?p=9532\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.afcd.gov.hk/tc_chi/conservation/con_nncp/con_nncp_list/files/5_Luk_Keng_Marsh.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.epd.gov.hk/eia/chi/register/permit/latest/figure/vep6302023figure3.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.epd.gov.hk/eia/register/permit/latest/figure/vep6072021figure3.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wikipedia.com/wiki/Fung_Lok_Wai\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:49:58.108Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "小冷水堆填区 具特殊科学价值地点 渔农自然护理署 鉴定", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01PXUWZ3EVBy5ZxkfKjiHfty", "content": [{"title": "Site of Special Scientific Interest (Hong Kong)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Site_of_Special_Scientific_Interest_(Hong_Kong)"}, {"title": "10822 Appendix", "url": "https://www.tpb.gov.hk/tc/uploads/TPB/paper/10822_Appendix.pdf"}, {"title": "msn sssi c", "url": "https://www.tpb.gov.hk/sc/forms/Schedule_Notes/msn_sssi_c.pdf"}, {"title": "Officials to throw out owner's bid to legalise dumping", "url": "https://amp.scmp.com/article/709004/officials-throw-out-owners-bid-legalise-dumping"}, {"title": "waihekegulfnews.co.nz", "url": "https://waihekegulfnews.co.nz/?p=9532"}, {"title": "5 Luk Keng Marsh", "url": "https://www.afcd.gov.hk/tc_chi/conservation/con_nncp/con_nncp_list/files/5_Luk_Keng_Marsh.pdf"}, {"title": "www.epd.gov.hk", "url": "https://www.epd.gov.hk/eia/chi/register/permit/latest/figure/vep6302023figure3.pdf"}, {"title": "www.epd.gov.hk", "url": "https://www.epd.gov.hk/eia/register/permit/latest/figure/vep6072021figure3.pdf"}, {"title": "Fung Lok Wai", "url": "https://wikipedia.com/wiki/Fung_Lok_Wai"}]}, "搜索结果没有直接说明小冷水堆填区是否曾被鉴定为具特殊科学价值地点（SSSI），也没有找到渔农自然护理署对该地点的鉴定记录。下面是相关的间接信息：\n\n- **SSSI的基本概念**：香港的具特殊科学价值地点，是基于科学价值而设的保护区，用于保护野生动植物、生境和地质地貌。这类地点由渔农自然护理署鉴定，之后由规划署记录并标示在地图上。A Site of Special Scientific Interest (具特殊科學價值地點) or SSSI is a special area to protect wildlife, habitats and geographic features based on scientific interest in Hong Kong. 这一来源未提供鉴定的具体程序细节。\n- **规划用途限制**：根据城市规划委员会的分区计划说明，此地带的规划意向是保存和保护具特殊科学价值的景物，地带内一般不宜发展。这些地方均劃作「具特殊科學價值地點」。設立此地帶的目的，是阻止市民在地帶內進行活動或發展。\n- **小冷水堆填区的相关资料**：环保署的环境许可证文件涉及屯门第38区填料库扩展项目，其中包含\"已修复的小冷水堆填区的诸询区域\"图。这只说明该填区已修复，并未提及SSSI的状况。Expansion and Extension of Fill Bank at Tuen Mun Area 38 – Consultation Zone of the Restored Siu Lang Shui Landfill\n\n**建议**：若需确认，可直接查阅渔农自然护理署的自然保育网页或其SSSI名单，以及城市规划委员会相关分区计划图则。维基百科的SSSI条目也列出了历年指定和撤销的地点，但搜索结果中只显示了部分名单，未包含小冷水堆。"], "durationSeconds": 7.664405667, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01KbAJ2GRkMr7xWzY5Jv6xwN", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
