{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01YXDdEfZYnpw22XrnBLmFsu", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waste_management_in_Hong_Kong\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/201311/06/P201311060264_print.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.epd.gov.hk/epd/english/environmentinhk/waste/prob_solutions/msw_si_lra.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/201605/25/P201605250480_print.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/201604/06/P201604060557_print.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/202005/26/P2020052600622p.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.epd.gov.hk/epd/english/environmentinhk/eia_planning/sea/baseline_3_3.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://consult.environment-agency.gov.uk/psc/ip10-0ht-valencia-waste-management-limited/supporting_documents/Application%20Variation%20Habitats%20risk%20assessment%20V009%2014112023.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/201706/15/P2017061500712p.htm\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:50:05.684Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Siu Lang Shui Landfill Site of Special Scientific Interest AFCD year identified", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01YUqVjnXm52Rf2NoDSKbQNT", "content": [{"title": "Waste management in Hong Kong", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waste_management_in_Hong_Kong"}, {"title": "LCQ22: Restored landfills", "url": "https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/201311/06/P201311060264_print.htm"}, {"title": "General Information", "url": "https://www.epd.gov.hk/epd/english/environmentinhk/waste/prob_solutions/msw_si_lra.html"}, {"title": "LCQ3: Setting aside a site at Siu Lang Shui in Tuen Mun for storing idling roadside cargo compartments", "url": "https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/201605/25/P201605250480_print.htm"}, {"title": "EPD to initiate prosecution against illegal dumping of construction waste at Tsim Bei Tsui, Deep Bay", "url": "https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/201604/06/P201604060557_print.htm"}, {"title": "www.info.gov.hk", "url": "https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/202005/26/P2020052600622p.htm"}, {"title": "baseline 3 3", "url": "https://www.epd.gov.hk/epd/english/environmentinhk/eia_planning/sea/baseline_3_3.html"}, {"title": "environment-agency.gov.uk", "url": "https://consult.environment-agency.gov.uk/psc/ip10-0ht-valencia-waste-management-limited/supporting_documents/Application%20Variation%20Habitats%20risk%20assessment%20V009%2014112023.pdf"}, {"title": "Non-in-situ land exchange agreed to promote long-term conservation of Sha Lo Tung (with photos)", "url": "https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/201706/15/P2017061500712p.htm"}]}, "The search didn't find the year Siu Lang Shui was identified or designated as a Site of Special Scientific Interest (SSSI), and none of the results mention AFCD (Agriculture, Fisheries and Conservation Department) as the source of that designation.\n\nWhat the results do say:\n\n- A government reply states that part of the landfill at Siu Lang Shui has been designated as a \"Site of Special Scientific Interest\" due to the butterfly over-wintering phenomenon. The reply gives no date.\n- A 2016 Legislative Council question notes that at SLS there is a butterfly reserve which has been listed as a Site of Special Scientific Interest. This also gives no designation year.\n- Background on the site: a government landfill table lists Siu Lang Shui as a landfill with an area of 12 hectares, and Landfill Closed in 1983. A separate table gives the closure as 1999–2000 and notes the site is now zoned as Green Belt. The two sources disagree on the closure date, but neither addresses the SSSI designation.\n\nTo find the designation year, I'd suggest checking AFCD's SSSI list or the Hong Kong Planning Department's Outline Zoning Plan for Siu Lang Shui, or the Legislative Council papers on the site's butterfly reserve."], "durationSeconds": 5.184389790999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01YXDdEfZYnpw22XrnBLmFsu", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
