{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_013KeAJ89pFmVrbNbinSQtsX", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.afcd.gov.hk/tc_chi/publications/publications_con/files/hkbonewsletter6.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20131006_Danaids_e.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://download.greenpower.org.hk/press/20160301_butterfly_e.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://download.greenpower.org.hk/press/20180322_butterfly_e.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://download.greenpower.org.hk/press/20170223_butterfly_e.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20160301_Danaids_e.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20140319_Danaids_e.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/eng/butterfly-overwintering\"}, {\"url\": \"https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20150211_Danaids_e.pdf\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:50:30.008Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"Siu Lang Shui\" SSSI butterfly overwintering site designated Tuen Mun \"SSSI\" since", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01GSjgDnMi5RuxbuX7RiQa1V", "content": [{"title": "www.afcd.gov.hk", "url": "https://www.afcd.gov.hk/tc_chi/publications/publications_con/files/hkbonewsletter6.pdf"}, {"title": "20131006 Danaids e", "url": "https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20131006_Danaids_e.pdf"}, {"title": "20160301 butterfly e", "url": "https://download.greenpower.org.hk/press/20160301_butterfly_e.pdf"}, {"title": "20180322 butterfly e", "url": "https://download.greenpower.org.hk/press/20180322_butterfly_e.pdf"}, {"title": "20170223 butterfly e", "url": "https://download.greenpower.org.hk/press/20170223_butterfly_e.pdf"}, {"title": "20160301 Danaids e", "url": "https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20160301_Danaids_e.pdf"}, {"title": "20140319 Danaids e", "url": "https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20140319_Danaids_e.pdf"}, {"title": "Butterfly ‧ Overwintering", "url": "https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/eng/butterfly-overwintering"}, {"title": "20150211 Danaids e", "url": "https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20150211_Danaids_e.pdf"}]}, "The search points to 2009 as the designation year, though the only source for that date is an environmental NGO, Green Power, so I couldn't confirm it against an official government record.\n\n- **Designation:** Green Power's butterfly overwintering page says the closed landfill was designated as a Site of Special Scientific Interest in 2009.\n- **Status:** Green Power describes it as the largest overwintering site for Danaids in Hong Kong, and the only \"Site of Special Scientific Interest\" set up to protect overwintering Danaids. It is in Tuen Mun and is a restored landfill.\n- **Population:** Counts have swung widely. One 2016 release reported about 40-fold growth in 2015, to 1,587 Danaids, but a later 2017 release recorded only 66 Danaids in 2016, a 96% drop. Historical literature suggests far larger numbers: In the peak period from 1999 to 2005, some 4,000 to 40,000 overwintering Danaids could be found there.\n- **Behaviour change:** A 2015 Green Power release suggested the site may be shifting role, with butterflies shortening their length of stay, which led it to suggest the site as a stop-over rather than a overwintering site.\n- **Development pressure:** Green Power has argued that nearby planned development could disturb the butterflies, and a green belt zone is meant to serve as a buffer between Siu Lang Siu SSSI and urban area."], "durationSeconds": 8.242434042000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_013KeAJ89pFmVrbNbinSQtsX", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_011qNZLPvcdY5ePmfMn4EXn5", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20160301_Danaids_c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20170223_Danaids_c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20150211_Danaids_c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20230319_c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20140319_Danaids_c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20200312_Danaids_c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20120223_Danaids_c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20240317c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20180322_Danaids_c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20110619_Danaids_c.pdf\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:50:34.854Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "小冷水 斑蝶越冬 具特殊科學價值地點 於 年 劃定 維基百科", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01LvWAcfgohan52HMNHKnoEb", "content": [{"title": "20160301 Danaids c", "url": "https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20160301_Danaids_c.pdf"}, {"title": "20170223 Danaids c", "url": "https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20170223_Danaids_c.pdf"}, {"title": "20150211 Danaids c", "url": "https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20150211_Danaids_c.pdf"}, {"title": "20230319 c", "url": "https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20230319_c.pdf"}, {"title": "20140319 Danaids c", "url": "https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20140319_Danaids_c.pdf"}, {"title": "20200312 Danaids c", "url": "https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20200312_Danaids_c.pdf"}, {"title": "20120223 Danaids c", "url": "https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20120223_Danaids_c.pdf"}, {"title": "download.greenpower.org.hk", "url": "https://download.greenpower.org.hk/butterfly/press/20240317c.pdf"}, {"title": "20180322 Danaids c", "url": "https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20180322_Danaids_c.pdf"}, {"title": "20110619 Danaids c", "url": "https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20110619_Danaids_c.pdf"}]}, "搜尋結果中沒有維基百科的條目，也沒有提到小冷水何時被劃定為「具特殊科學價值地點」（SSSI），所以無法確認劃定年份。\n\n綠色力量的新聞稿提到，位於屯門的小冷水是全港最大規模的斑蝶越冬地，亦是本港唯一為保護越冬斑蝶而設的「具特殊科學價值地點」。另一份文件補充，1999 年至 2005 年高峰期，小冷水可找到 4,000 至 40,000 隻越冬斑蝶。\n\n近年數量波動很大。2014 年調查數目再次下降至歷史低位，只有 41 隻。 2015 年冬天於十一月尾錄得最多越冬斑蝶達 1,587 隻，而 2016 年冬天錄得 66 隻，較上一年大幅下降 96%。 2022 年 10 月至 2023 年 1 月的冬天，小冷水錄得最多越冬斑蝶，有 601 隻。\n\n如需確認劃定年份，建議查閱香港政府的《具特殊科學價值地點》相關資料或維基百科條目。"], "durationSeconds": 12.984057084, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_011qNZLPvcdY5ePmfMn4EXn5", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
