{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDX1ihdqnAr3jNZpVADB", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案:2009 年**(证据较弱,见下)。\n\n绿色力量(Green Power)的「越冬斑蝶」网页写道,小冷水这个已修复的堆填区在 2009 年被指定为具特殊科学价值地点(SSSI)。它是香港最大的斑蝶越冬地,也是本港唯一为保护越冬斑蝶而设的 SSSI。\n\n- **来源不是官方**:这个年份只有绿色力量(环保团体)这一个出处。我没有找到渔农自然护理署或规划署的原始记录来核实。\n- **没有逐字对上提问**:该页说的是「被指定」。我没有查到哪个来源写明是渔护署「鉴定」的。\n- **搜索次数**:5 次搜索已用完。\n\n依据网址:\n- [Butterfly ‧ Overwintering(绿色力量)](https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/eng/butterfly-overwintering)\n- [20160301 Danaids c(绿色力量新闻稿,证明小冷水是唯一为越冬斑蝶而设的 SSSI)](https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20160301_Danaids_c.pdf)\n- [LCQ3(政府新闻公报,提到该蝴蝶保护区已列为 SSSI,未给年份)](https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/201605/25/P201605250480_print.htm)\n\nSources:\n- [Butterfly ‧ Overwintering](https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/eng/butterfly-overwintering)\n- [20160301 Danaids c](https://butterfly.greenpower.org.hk/download/press/20160301_Danaids_c.pdf)\n- [LCQ3: Setting aside a site at Siu Lang Shui](https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/201605/25/P201605250480_print.htm)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2399, "cache_read_input_tokens": 8412, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2399}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:50:42.183Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDX1i5vHubRJJYXMxMhb"}
